00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:22,640
I get to go on customer calls all the time or potential customer calls, but then it's like, but I'm not actually in sales, so I don't have to like actually do the hard part of the job.

422
00:31:24,800 --> 00:31:29,600
And like engineering, it's like, I can submit a PR here and there, but it's like, but nobody's expecting me to.

423
00:31:29,840 --> 00:31:32,560
Anytime I do it, it's like, oh, thank you for doing some extra work for us.

424
00:31:35,200 --> 00:31:48,880
So it's like everything I do is like a cheap cheating version of all these different hats, which we've talked about, I think, on the show is part of what we liked about Indie development is we like what we do.

425
00:31:48,880 --> 00:31:49,760
We like to wear all the hats.

426
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:56,160
We like to learn about marketing and learning about customer support and learning about all these things.

427
00:31:56,560 --> 00:32:00,560
