00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:36,640
So like, and it kind of goes back to what I was foreshadowing before about kind of learning from the companies that are doing, you know, the App Store well.

494
00:36:37,440 --> 00:36:48,880
And my thing with Elite Hoops is I wasn't going to think of it so much as an indie app, like where I really wanted to get, you know, the press coverage or, you know, the App Store feature, which to be clear, I would absolutely love those things.

495
00:36:49,040 --> 00:36:58,320
I still try for them, but I had a huge emphasis on those as growth levers before, and I kind of got to the point where it was like, I'm just going to try and make my own luck with this thing.

