00:36:58,560 --> 00:37:15,040
So in a blog post I just put up last night, actually, about like a big feature I just shipped, it's this whole Practice Planner suite where like you can create drills, you can make practice plans, and then you can run them interactively on your phone, kind of like how Instagram stories goes through your stories, or you can just print it out.

